# DBV v2 filter module

Config-driven per-tab filters for `DatabasePage` (`/data`).

- `dbvFilterConfig.ts` — which filter groups each `CatalogType` exposes.
- `dbvFilterPredicates.ts` — pure `cardMatchesDbvFilters` and filter predicate helpers.
- `useDbvFilters.ts` — React state, chips, reset on tab change.
- UI: `../components/DbvFilterRail.tsx` and strip/numeric subcomponents.

Do not duplicate filter logic in `DatabasePage.tsx`; extend config + predicates here.
